{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Make admissions to children's indoor play centres zero-rated for VAT",
        "additional_details": "The Government has already recognised the value of children's indoor play through a temporary VAT reduction. Making this permanent could help families access safe, active play all year round. Indoor play supports children's physical health, mental well-being, learning and social development. A permanent zero rate of VAT could improve affordability for families, support community businesses and help encourage healthier lifestyles.",
        "background": "We want the Government to permanently zero rate VAT from admissions to children's indoor play centres to make active play more affordable, improve access for families and support children's health, well-being and development.",
